{"Title":"An Act to increase access to blood donation","BillNumber":"S2994","DocketNumber":null,"GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"S30","Name":"Senate Committee on Ways and Means","Type":2,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/S30","ResponseDate":"2024-12-17T14:05:12.073"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"BRF0","Name":"Barry R. Finegold","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/BRF0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-17T19:42:53.34"},{"Id":"PMO","Name":"Patrick M. O'Connor","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/PMO","ResponseDate":"2023-06-08T15:57:19.9966667"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S2994/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"Senate, December 19, 2024 -- The committee on Senate Ways and Means, to whom was referred the Senate Bill to increase access to blood donation (Senate, No. 1372),- reports, recommending that the same ought to pass with an amendment substituting a new draft (Senate, No. 2994).","DocumentText":"\tSection 184B of chapter 111 of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2022 Official Edition, is hereby amended by striking out the second sentence and inserting in place thereof the following sentence:- The American Red Cross, the Center for Blood Research, Inc., federal hospitals, organizations registered as blood establishments with the United States Food and Drug Administration and hospitals operated by the department of public health may establish and maintain a blood bank, provided that such blood bank is approved by the commissioner and the public health council as meeting all applicable regulations developed under the authority of this chapter. \r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Favorable with Amendment","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H34","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H34"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Place in OD","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H52","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H52"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Correctly Drawn","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H36","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H36"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[{"AmendmentNumber":"1","ParentBillNumber":"S2994","Branch":"House","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S2994/Branches/House/Amendments/1/"}]}